# .NET build output and test results. No repo-root .gitignore exists anymore, so this also
# covers OS/IDE files, and — critically — .env, under this tree; that protection used to come
# from the root file. Caught the hard way: .env staged itself here once the root file was gone.
bin/
obj/
*.user
TestResults/
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
